DESCRIPTION:The Dorothy Cotton Jubilee Singers will present a special prog
 ram of gratefulness as we usher in the season of Thanksgiving.\nJoin us fo
 r an afternoon of music from the African Diaspora\, featuring spirituals\,
  anthems\, and gospel selections that celebrate gratitude\, hope\, resilie
 nce\, and community.\nIn the midst of a world filled with uncertainty and 
 chaos\, we invite you to pause\, reflect\, and share in the joy of being t
 hankful.\nThe program is free and open to the public. Donations are welcom
 e.\nCome join us for an afternoon of music\, reflection\, and gratefulness
 .\nReserve your FREE tickets at:\nhttps://www.purplepass.com/events/381308
