BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The 25th Annual Putnam County Spelling Bee presented by Ithaca Col
 lege
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261106
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTSTAMP:20261102T192654Z
UID:01ac65ee0bd4ef5bb19aff4020b30147c0931244@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:THE 25TH ANNUAL PUTMAN COUNTY SPELLING BEE\nMusic and lyrics b
 y William Finn\nBook by Rachel Skeinkin\nConceived by Rebecca Feldman\nDir
 ected by Wendy Dann\nMusic Direction by Christopher Zemliauskas\nChoreogra
 phy by Aimee Rials and Colby Murphy\nNovember 6-9\, 2026\nHoerner Theatre
 \, Dillingham Center\nIthaca College School of Music\, Theatre\, and Dance
 \n953 Danby Road\, Ithaca\, NY\nAn eclectic group of six mid-pubescents vi
 e for the spelling championship of a lifetime. While candidly disclosing h
 ilarious and touching stories from their home lives\, the tweens spell the
 ir way through a series of (potentially made-up) words\, hoping never to h
 ear the soul-crushing\, pout-inducing\, life un-affirming "ding" of the be
 ll that signals a spelling mistake. Six spellers enter\; one speller leave
 s a champion! At least the losers get a juice box.\nReserve your tickets a
 t:\nhttps://www.purplepass.com/spellingbeeic\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - http
 s://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78503457/20261106000000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78503457/20261106000000
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Jessica Kirson @ State Theatre of Ithaca
DTSTART:20261106T000000Z
DTEND:20261106T045959Z
DTSTAMP:20261102T192654Z
UID:42c344f0fcded6557a5f3b74cdf7f7c993a2d975@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Performing Arts,Comedy
DESCRIPTION:Event by State Theatre of Ithaca\, Jessica Kirson and DSP Show
 s\nState Theatre of Ithaca\nPublic\nDSP Shows and The State Theatre of Ith
 aca Present:\nJessica Kirson\nThursday\, November 5th\, 2026\nDoors 6:00pm
  | Show 7:00pm\nTickets on sale FRIDAY Friday\, August 28th\, 2026 @ 10am 
 ET: https://tixr.com/e/203757\nJessica Kirson is a dynamic force in comedy
 \, celebrated for her high-energy performances\, ridiculous characters\, a
 nd self deprecating vulnerability. With a career spanning over two decades
 \, she has found an audience for her comedy on social media\, where she ha
 s racked up over a billion views.\nJessica's comedy journey began in the c
 lubs of New York City\, where her distinctive voice and unfiltered humor q
 uickly made her an audience favorite. Kirson has since performed on some o
 f the biggest stages in comedy\, including mulitple appearances on The Ton
 ight Show\, The View\, HBO’s Crashing\, and\, Kevin Can Wait. Jessica pr
 oduced FX's Hysterical\, a feature-length documentary exploring the changi
 ng landscape of women in stand-up comedy\, as well as serving as consultan
 t\, producer\, and onscreen talent in Robert DeNiro's\, “The Comedian”
 .\nKnown for years as a "Comic's Comic"\, Jessica's career has exploded in
  recent years as her social media accounts topped 1M followers on multiple
  platforms\, and her tour dates began to fill up with sold out theaters. I
 n an era where only 10% of all touring comedians are female\, Jessica stan
 ds out as one of the best comedians working today\, regardless of gender.
 \n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466313
 /20261105190000
GEO:42.439256;-76.499593
LOCATION:State Theatre of Ithaca\, 107 West State Street\, Ithaca\, New Yo
 rk\, 14850\, United States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78466313/20261105190000
END:VEVENT
