DESCRIPTION:Test your FLX knowledge & win a prize for a nonprofit particip
 ating in FLX Gives! Teams of up to 8 people are invited to join us for FLX
  Gives style trivia where winning prizes will go directly to a nonprofit p
 articipating in the 24-hour fundraiser. Hosted by Bulldog Sounds\, teams w
 ill register upon arrival and select a participating nonprofit to play for
 !\n1st place prize: $1\,000 for a participating nonprofit\n2nd place prize
 : $500 for a participating nonprofit\n3rd place price: $250 for a particip
 ating nonprofit\nFLX (Finger Lakes) Gives\, an initiative of the Community
  Foundation of Elmira-Corning and the Finger Lakes\, Inc.\, is a 24-hour o
 nline fundraiser for Finger Lakes nonprofits\, connecting community member
 s with the causes and charities they care most about. It is a day to fundr
 aise for and celebrate all that the Finger Lakes are\, and the critical ro
 le nonprofits play in making our community a great place to live\, give\, 
 and thrive!\nThis year's giving day will be held on November 12 & 13\, 202
 6\, from 6:00 p.m. to 6:00 p.m.\nTo learn more about #FLXGives and select 
 a participating nonprofit visit www.flxgives.org\nLocation: Carey's Brew H
 ouse\n58 Bridge Street\, Corning\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar
 .time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78503502/20261112190000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78503502/20261112190000
END:VEVENT
