 es that include environmentalism?\nEnjoy coffee\, snacks\, and good conver
 sation. Doors open at 8:30 AM. The presentation begins at 9 AM.\nRemember 
 to bring your own reusable mug for coffee or tea.\nCoffee with Friends is 
 a free educational program. While donations are not expected\, they are gr
 eatly appreciated.\nLet us know you're coming by registering today!\n\nSou
